-5.8% Last 3m
UnitedHealth Group is one of the largest private health insurers and provides=
 medical benefits to about 51 million members globally, including 1 million o=
utside the US as of December 2025. As a leader in employer-sponsored, self-di=
rected, and government-backed insurance plans, UnitedHealth has obtained mass=
ive scale in medical insurance. Along with its insurance assets, UnitedHealth=
's Optum franchises help create a healthcare services colossus that spans eve=
rything from pharmaceutical benefits to providing outpatient care and analyti=
cs to affiliates and third parties.
